    "note": "Straps include dedicated BOOT GPIO0. GPIO3/45/46 unused. All 27 available general GPIO are allocated after GPIO42 becomes ADC_SHDN_N. Expander frees three GPIO; USB negotiation consumes two. Start/Enter uses RTC-capable GPIO7 for sleep wake. No off-board PDM input on this revision."
