    "Buttons and case actuator dimensions not mechanically approved.",
    "Transient/USB/I2C timing and powered-off leakage require bench validation.",
    "Battery-backed RTC requires initial EEPROM configuration and time synchronization; no independent backup cell.",
    "No assembled prototype or electrical rule check from final CAD has yet validated this draft.",
    "ADC-to-ESP32 TDM slot order, edge polarity, 32-bit sample alignment and four-channel WAV format need an actual bench recording.",
