      "notes": "Exact N16R8 ordering code only. GPIO35-37 are reserved for internal Octal PSRAM; leave disconnected. GPIO3/45/46 left unused. GPIO4/5 are I2S0 master TDM clocks, GPIO6 captures ADC output and GPIO42 controls ADC shutdown; GPIO7 is Start/Enter and RTC-domain wake input. GPIO43 is UART0 TX at ROM boot: LCD_CS_N external pull-up prevents interpreting ROM transitions. Native USB is the service interface; LCD uses SPI2_HOST, not the flash SPI1 bus. GPIO47/48 are valid 3.3V for N16R8; do not silently substitute N16R16VA.",
